---
import Policy from "../layouts/Policy.astro";
import { REFUND_ADDRESS, REMOVAL_ADDRESS } from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Policy title="Refunds">
  <p>
    The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund is a FOSS United community initiative, run by volunteers. We adopt the
    donation-refund principles in the FOSS United <a
      href="https://fossunited.org/refund-transfer-policy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-link">refund and transfer policy</a
    >, as reviewed on 7 September 2026: submit claims promptly, provide transaction details, and
    expect each donation made in error to be reviewed on its own. The local rules below apply to
    this fund and take precedence where the source differs. Ticket-transfer rules do not apply.
    Later changes to the source do not change this policy automatically.
  </p>
  <h2>Before launch</h2>
  <p>
    This site takes no payments at this stage. Joining the mailing list does not charge you or
    create a payment obligation. Contributions will go into a FOSS United Foundation account. We
    will publish the refund contact, claim period, and recurring-payment cancellation process before
    contributions open.
  </p>
  <h2>Donations to the Foundation’s own programmes</h2>
  <p>
    If you donated directly to FOSS United Foundation, its policy asks you to email{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${REFUND_ADDRESS}`} class="inline-link">{REFUND_ADDRESS}</a> within 15 days. That
    process concerns direct donations to the Foundation. Refunds of contributions to The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund
    follow the rules that we publish before contributions open.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund, send an email to <a
      href={`mailto:${REMOVAL_ADDRESS}`}
      class="inline-link">{REMOVAL_ADDRESS}</a
    >.
  </p>
</Policy>
